---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy — DiskPrune"
  description="DiskPrune scans stay on your Mac. We store what Stripe and licensing require: email, hashed key, seats. We do not upload your file list."
>
  <main class="prose-page mx-auto max-w-prose px-6 py-16">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight">Privacy</h1>
    <p class="mt-4 text-muted">Last updated 11 September 2026.</p>
    <p class="mt-4 text-muted leading-relaxed">
      DiskPrune is a native macOS app. Scans and cleanup plans stay on your Mac. We do not
      upload your file list, paths, or disk map.
    </p>
    <p class="mt-4 text-muted leading-relaxed">
      When you buy a license we receive, via Stripe, your email address and payment status.
      We store a hashed license key, an encrypted copy of that key, your email, device seat
      identifiers you activate, and Stripe session/customer ids. That is what we need to
      email the key, enforce the 3-Mac seat limit, and handle refunds.
    </p>
    <p class="mt-4 text-muted leading-relaxed">
      We use Stripe for payment, Resend to deliver the license email, and Cloudflare to host
      the licensing API. We do not sell your email. We do not put license keys in URLs or
      in the browser after checkout.
    </p>
    <p class="mt-4 text-muted leading-relaxed">
      To delete your license record, email support@diskprune.com. Refunds are described on
      the <a href="/refunds">refunds</a> page.
    </p>
  </main>
</Layout>
